  "$comment": "Representative fits, the encounters each one is set against, and the bands their outcomes must measure inside (MVP Implementation Plan phases 16-17; MVP Scope 4.1-4.3). Fits name only definitions and quantities: tests/support/progression/assemble.ts buys and fits them through the ordinary station commands, so every item here must be sold at the starting station. Tactics are what a competent pilot does with the ordinary controls, using only the range and arrival distances the interface offers. Seeds fix each campaign's random streams, so every band is deterministic; a scenario with several sorties per seed proves the site stays repeatable. The dominance witnesses reason from the bands alone: each representative fit is strictly outperformed somewhere, so none is the best choice everywhere.",
